      <activity id="75db21ed-560b-545b-b763-a6c63ebca441" activityNameId="8cbfa1c0-a147-533b-a11f-b684a28109fc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, supply mix GO</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, supply mix GO
Electricity domestic net production shares are based on annual averages for the year 2019; UUID:7981d0dd-f80c-3508-8ba2-45cd7d99326a
Included are the shares of domestic electricity production  and imports by technology at the busbar. Not included are transformation, transport or distribution losses
Location: Data apply to public and self producers in Switzerland and from imports.
Wind power plants are European averages.
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time period of statistics used.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistical data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7981d0dd-f80c-3508-8ba2-45cd7d99326a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
